  "question": {
    "text": "A cyclotron is used to accelerate protons. If the operating magnetic field is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> and the radius of the cyclotron &#39;dees&#39; is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>, the kinetic energy of the accelerated protons in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MeV</mi></math> will be :<br />[use <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>]",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
