  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>When the proton&nbsp;is rotated in a cyclotron its maximum velocity will be corresponding to the maximum radius of the circular path. We know that the radius of the circle in a magnetic field is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></math>.</p><p>The kinetic energy will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MeV</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MeV</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace></math></p></blockquote>",
